  "id": "tpq",
  "term": "TPQ",
  "definition": "TPQ, or the theory of psychic quanta, is a proposed model of consciousness that treats subjective experience as built from basic units called informational quanta within a universal psychic field. It aims to offer a new account of subjectivity that connects ideas from psychology, neuroscience, physics, and philosophy of mind.",
